# Load an existing robot (the one 07-save made, in cell 5), change its armour on the Chassis > Armor screen with
# "apply default chassis appearance" checked, Finished, Back to HQ (re-saves the file): usage `08-edit-armor.steps`
# is run once per plate with ARMOR_Y = the armour grid row's y (plastic 188, aluminum 266, steel 350, titanium 435
# in the 1024x768 frame: the grid rows are 84 px apart from y 190).
click 790 435     # the robot's cell
wait 1
click 905 659     # Workshop
wait 8
click 352 89      # Chassis tab
wait 2
click 585 332     # Armor
wait 2
click 700 ARMOR_Y
wait 1
hide
shot SHOTS/ARMOR_NAME-armor.png
click 962 666     # Finished
wait 2
click 262 88      # Overview
wait 3
hide
shot SHOTS/ARMOR_NAME-overview.png
click 55 18       # Back to HQ: re-saves
wait 5
